         body      0.800 x 0.550 m, deck top at 0.350 m
         wheels    r 0.100, separation 0.440, differential, casters fore/aft
         livery    charcoal chassis, hazard-yellow bumper band, grey load deck

       No saturated marker disks: heading is carried by the chassis itself.
       Seen from an oblique ceiling camera the front has a recessed sensor
       bar and the rear a raised control cabinet, so front and rear are
       distinguishable from above without lab colours.

       The Gazebo entity is still spawned as `turtlebot3` (bringup_sim.launch.py
       `-name`), so every /model/turtlebot3/... bridge and remap is unchanged.

       Keypoints stay virtual points anchored on the chassis, at the deck
